        "subject": "LU-20758 tests: relax sanity/63c OST_SYNC upper bound",
        "message": "LU-20758 tests: relax sanity/63c OST_SYNC upper bound\n\nsanity/63c writes a fully striped file and verifies that sync_on_close\nissues at least one OST_SYNC per stripe. The current test also caps\nthe count below 2 * stripes, but background or reclaim writeback can\nissue additional OST_SYNC RPCs while dd is still writing, so\n2 * stripes is not a hard upper bound.\n\nChange the assertion to check only the lower bound, and make the error\nmessage print that bound instead of an equality. The test remains a\nlower-bound smoke check for the sync_on_close path; it no longer fails\non valid additional background writeback.\n\nFixes: 1cf465d79a3b3055d89bdcfca496436ea0fca4c0 (\"LU-16049 llite: add sync_on_close option\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity\nSigned-off-by: Xiyang Wang <xiwang@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I1bb2d62b858a27339a5b74270c143e6bc6bc19a2\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
